RQ2 9.2 round 2 (Tier 1, ML_Options.md) - strong baselines and probabilistic forecasts.
Rolling origin, sliding window (24 months; weekly 48), refit every 3 months (weekly 12); test from 2021-01-01; errors in EUR/MWh on the common rows of all point models and baselines.
Models: LEAR (LASSO), LightGBM quantile, CatBoost MultiQuantile, Quantile Regression Forest, SVR (RBF); quantiles 05, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80, 90, 95; seeds 1; LEAR target delta.
No hyperparameter search (fixed defaults; LEAR alpha by LassoCV, TimeSeriesSplit(4)).
lgbm_l1 = round-1 LightGBM (rq2_2_delta), merged for comparison.

